y 2 copies remain unshown, making it unlikely to be useful, (3) It doesn't contribute to any viable scoring pattern given my current hand structure, (4) The previous player has already shown interest in Characters suit with multiple melds, reducing risk.\n\nAnswer: Play W5"}
