g is nearly impossible. The winds are dead tiles blocking my hand development.\n\n**Discard Priority:**\nF1 or F2 are the safest discards. Between them, F2 appears slightly safer as F1 has already been discarded multiple times by opponents.\n\nReason: F2 is an isolated honor tile with only 1 remaining unshown copy, making it nearly impossible to form a meld. It provides no scoring value (not prevalent wind, not my seat wind) and blocks hand development. Discarding it allows me to focus on developing melds with my suited tiles (T3 pair, B1 pair) which have better completion potential.\n\nAnswer: Play F2"}
